<title>USA: Essex County, N.J., $50 mln BANs won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Essex County, N.J., $50 mln BANs won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities on Thursday won $50.2 million of Essex County, N.J., bond anticipation notes (BANs).</p>
<p>The coupon was 4.24 percent and the net interest cost was 3.9509 percent. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
